<title>FINLAND: Stockmann 1996 profit up 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Stockmann 1996 profit up 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>	  (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items,tax	315 vs 280</p>
<p> Sales						7,420 up 19 pct</p>
<p> Net sales					  6,164 up 18 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish retail group Oy Stockmann Ab's was for a 295 million markka profit. Stockmann said the 315 million markka profit is an approximate figure and it includes a 15 million markka sales profit mainly from the sale of Tuko shares.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
